== a_log_scale_on_dates
note: 1 row with NA in day or level dropped (line 4)
error[Z0401]: the `x` axis holds the dates of `day`, which are placed in proportion to the time and on no other scale
 --> scripts/main.zeff:4:43
  |
4 | r.plot(x: day, y: level).points().scale_x(log)
  |                                           ^^^ a log scale is for numbers
  |
  = help: a log or a square-root scale is set on an axis of numbers

